# Content

- Projects are `content/projects/*.mdx`, frontmatter only, validated by `projectSchema` in `src/lib/projects.ts`. Logos are files in `public/logos`.
- Roles are `content/experience/*.mdx`, frontmatter only, validated by `experienceSchema` in `src/lib/experience.ts`.
- Blog posts are MDX in `content/blog` (Fumadocs `add blog`). Routes are `src/app/(home)/blog`. A post without `authors` is by the site's author.
- Write only what is true of dimah-kz and the public repositories. No placeholder projects, roles, or invented biography.
- A new document-shaped section is a new Fumadocs collection, then a route. Not a hardcoded array in a component.
- Name, profile links, and contact stay in `src/lib/site.ts`; description, tagline, home copy, and the About section (paragraphs and timeline) are in `site.copy`, once per language. Skills are `site.skills`.
- Translations sit next to the original: `<name>.<locale>.mdx`. A project or role translation holds only the fields that change; a post translation is the whole post.
- Interface labels are in `messages/en.json` and `messages/fa.json`. Add a label to every file.
- A new page gets a Markdown version in `markdownPages()` in `src/lib/agents.ts`.
- Fumadocs APIs: https://fumadocs.dev/llms.txt

Guide: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)
